{"seq":4,"slug":"permissions-and-roles","title":"权限与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/permissions-and-roles","wordCount":2170,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"权限与角色\">权限与角色</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协作应用(Collaborative App)必须实现访问控制——决定谁可以编辑、查看、评论、分享和删除。常见角色包括所有者(Owner)、编辑者(Editor)、评论者(Commenter)和查看者(Viewer)，这一模式源自 Google Docs。分享体验包含链接分享（任何拥有链接的人）、邮件邀请和组织级范围限定。权限检查不仅仅是服务端的事——客户端界面也需要反映权限状态（例如对查看者禁用编辑按钮）。现代 PaaS 方案（如 Liveblocks）和自建后端各有取舍。本节讲解角色层级、权限模型、分享体验、双端执行（客户端+服务端）以及审计日志。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>权限</th>\n<th>界面表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>所有者</td>\n<td>全部权限 + 删除 + 转让所有权</td>\n<td>完整编辑 + 管理功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编辑者</td>\n<td>读取 + 写入 + 评论 + 分享</td>\n<td>完整编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评论者</td>\n<td>读取 + 评论</td>\n<td>查看 + 添加评论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查看者</td>\n<td>仅读取</td>\n<td>仅查看，隐藏编辑界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匿名用户</td>\n<td>取决于分享设置</td>\n<td>可能的受限查看</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"角色层级\">角色层级</h2><p><strong>标准层级</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Owner &gt; Editor &gt; Commenter &gt; Viewer\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Owner > Editor > Commenter > Viewer</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>每个高级角色继承低级角色的全部权限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有者可以执行编辑者的所有操作。</li>\n<li>编辑者可以执行评论者的所有操作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自定义角色</strong>（部分应用支持）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按功能粒度授权。</li>\n<li>例如：可以编辑 X 但不能编辑 Y。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"权限检查\">权限检查</h2><p><strong>服务端为权威来源</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function canEdit(userId, docId) {&#10;  const member = await db.members.findOne({ userId, docId });&#10;  return member &amp;&amp; [&#39;owner&#39;, &#39;editor&#39;].includes(member.role);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 每次变更操作都进行检查&#10;if (!(await canEdit(userId, docId))) {&#10;  throw new Error(&#39;Forbidden&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function canEdit(userId, docId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const member = await db.members.findOne({ userId, docId });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return member &#x26;&#x26; ['owner', 'editor'].includes(member.role);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 每次变更操作都进行检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (!(await canEdit(userId, docId))) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  throw new Error('Forbidden');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>客户端界面适配</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  userRole === &#39;editor&#39; || userRole === &#39;owner&#39; ? &lt;EditButton /&gt; : &lt;ViewOnlyIndicator /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  userRole === 'editor' || userRole === 'owner' ? &#x3C;EditButton /> : &#x3C;ViewOnlyIndicator />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>两端都不可或缺</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>客户端体验层面：不展示用户无权执行的操作。</li>\n<li>服务端强制校验：不信任客户端。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户操作] --&gt; B{客户端检查角色?}&#10;    B -- 无权限 --&gt; C[隐藏界面]&#10;    B -- 有权限 --&gt; D[展示按钮]&#10;    D --&gt; E[点击操作]&#10;    E --&gt; F[服务端检查角色]&#10;    F -- 拒绝 --&gt; G[返回 403]&#10;    F -- 允许 --&gt; H[执行变更]\">graph TD\n    A[用户操作] --&gt; B{客户端检查角色?}\n    B -- 无权限 --&gt; C[隐藏界面]\n    B -- 有权限 --&gt; D[展示按钮]\n    D --&gt; E[点击操作]\n    E --&gt; F[服务端检查角色]\n    F -- 拒绝 --&gt; G[返回 403]\n    F -- 允许 --&gt; H[执行变更]</pre><h2 id=\"分享体验\">分享体验</h2><p><strong>弹窗模式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"&lt;ShareModal&gt;&#10;  &lt;h3&gt;Share document&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;section&gt;&#10;    &lt;h4&gt;People with access&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      &lt;li&gt;&#10;        &lt;Avatar src={alice.avatar} /&gt;&#10;        Alice (Owner)&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;      &lt;li&gt;&#10;        &lt;Avatar src={bob.avatar} /&gt;&#10;        Bob&#10;        &lt;RoleSelect value=&quot;editor&quot; onChange={...}&gt;&#10;          &lt;option value=&quot;editor&quot;&gt;Can edit&lt;/option&gt;&#10;          &lt;option value=&quot;commenter&quot;&gt;Can comment&lt;/option&gt;&#10;          &lt;option value=&quot;viewer&quot;&gt;Can view&lt;/option&gt;&#10;        &lt;/RoleSelect&gt;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  &lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;section&gt;&#10;    &lt;h4&gt;Add people&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;    &lt;input type=&quot;email&quot; placeholder=&quot;Email&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;RoleSelect&gt;...&lt;/RoleSelect&gt;&#10;    &lt;Button&gt;Send invite&lt;/Button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;section&gt;&#10;    &lt;h4&gt;Link sharing&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;    &lt;Toggle checked={linkSharing}&gt;Anyone with the link&lt;/Toggle&gt;&#10;    {linkSharing &amp;&amp; (&#10;      &lt;RoleSelect&gt;&#10;        &lt;option&gt;Can view&lt;/option&gt;&#10;        &lt;option&gt;Can comment&lt;/option&gt;&#10;        &lt;option&gt;Can edit&lt;/option&gt;&#10;      &lt;/RoleSelect&gt;&#10;    )}&#10;    &lt;Button onClick={copyLink}&gt;Copy link&lt;/Button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;/ShareModal&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;ShareModal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;h3>Share document&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;section></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;h4>People with access&#x3C;/h4></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Avatar src={alice.avatar} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Alice (Owner)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Avatar src={bob.avatar} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Bob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;RoleSelect value=\"editor\" onChange={...}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;option value=\"editor\">Can edit&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;option value=\"commenter\">Can comment&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;option value=\"viewer\">Can view&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/RoleSelect></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/section></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;section></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;h4>Add people&#x3C;/h4></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;RoleSelect>...&#x3C;/RoleSelect></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Button>Send invite&#x3C;/Button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/section></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;section></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;h4>Link sharing&#x3C;/h4></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Toggle checked={linkSharing}>Anyone with the link&#x3C;/Toggle></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {linkSharing &#x26;&#x26; (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;RoleSelect></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;option>Can view&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;option>Can comment&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;option>Can edit&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/RoleSelect></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Button onClick={copyLink}>Copy link&#x3C;/Button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/section></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/ShareModal></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>行业标准模式（Google Docs / Notion）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>成员列表展示角色。</li>\n<li>通过邮件添加成员。</li>\n<li>链接分享开关 + 角色选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"邮件邀请\">邮件邀请</h2><p><strong>流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>所有者输入邮箱地址并选择角色。</li>\n<li>服务端发送包含链接的邀请邮件。</li>\n<li>收件人点击链接 → 登录（如需要）→ 接受邀请。</li>\n<li>写入成员表。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>待处理的邀请</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在成员列表中显示&quot;待接受&quot;标记。</li>\n<li>提供取消选项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"链接分享\">链接分享</h2><p><strong>任何拥有链接的人可访问</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成分享令牌(Share Token)。</li>\n<li>链接格式：<code>/doc/abc?share=token123</code>。</li>\n<li>链接中的令牌用于授予相应角色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>风险</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>链接一旦公开，任何人都能访问。</li>\n<li>撤销方式：轮换令牌。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>限制策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>邮箱白名单。</li>\n<li>组织范围限定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"组织级范围\">组织级范围</h2><p><strong>公司内部</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有员工默认拥有查看或评论权限。</li>\n<li>也可逐文档设置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>外部用户</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要显式邀请。</li>\n<li>可能赋予更严格的角色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>设置</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有者可选择默认权限级别。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"基于-crdt-操作的权限控制\">基于 CRDT 操作的权限控制</h2><p><strong>使用 Yjs 时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端中间件在应用操作前进行检查。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"function authorizeUpdate(userId, docId, update) {&#10;  const role = getRole(userId, docId);&#10;  if (role === &#39;viewer&#39;) return false;&#10;  if (role === &#39;commenter&#39;) {&#10;    // 仅允许评论相关的操作&#10;    return isCommentOp(update);&#10;  }&#10;  if (role === &#39;editor&#39; || role === &#39;owner&#39;) {&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;  return false;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function authorizeUpdate(userId, docId, update) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const role = getRole(userId, docId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (role === 'viewer') return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (role === 'commenter') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 仅允许评论相关的操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return isCommentOp(update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (role === 'editor' || role === 'owner') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>操作级粒度控制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对原始 CRDT 操作实现细粒度控制较困难。</li>\n<li>对结构化操作（如评论与正文内容分离）则更容易实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"只读模式\">只读模式</h2><p><strong>查看者不应发送任何更新</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"const editor = useEditor({&#10;  editable: userRole !== &#39;viewer&#39;,&#10;  extensions: [...]&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const editor = useEditor({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  editable: userRole !== 'viewer',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  extensions: [...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>禁用输入</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设置 contentEditable 为 false。</li>\n<li>或使用 readOnly 属性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不发布光标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>查看者不发布自身的感知状态(Awareness)。</li>\n<li>或发布只读指示器。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"仅评论模式\">仅评论模式</h2><p><strong>评论者可以</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>阅读内容。</li>\n<li>添加评论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不可以</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编辑正文内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>界面表现</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编辑区域设为只读。</li>\n<li>评论侧边栏保持可交互。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  isCommenter &amp;&amp; &lt;Banner&gt;You have comment-only access&lt;/Banner&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  isCommenter &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;Banner>You have comment-only access&#x3C;/Banner>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"审计日志\">审计日志</h2><p><strong>记录操作</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"await db.auditLog.insert({&#10;  userId,&#10;  docId,&#10;  action: &#39;edit&#39;,&#10;  timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;  details: { ... }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>await db.auditLog.insert({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  userId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  docId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  action: 'edit',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  timestamp: Date.now(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  details: { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>查看方式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅管理员或所有者可见。</li>\n<li>在&quot;活动记录&quot;标签页展示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常见记录的操作</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>创建、编辑、删除。</li>\n<li>分享、取消分享。</li>\n<li>角色变更。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实时权限变更\">实时权限变更</h2><p><strong>当所有者移除用户时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端踢出用户（关闭 WebSocket 连接）。</li>\n<li>客户端收到断开通知。</li>\n<li>界面更新为&quot;访问已撤销&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 服务端&#10;function removeMember(userId, docId) {&#10;  db.members.delete({ userId, docId });&#10;  // 断开该用户的连接&#10;  for (const ws of getSocketsForUser(userId, docId)) {&#10;    ws.close(1008, &#39;Access revoked&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 服务端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function removeMember(userId, docId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  db.members.delete({ userId, docId });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 断开该用户的连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const ws of getSocketsForUser(userId, docId)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.close(1008, 'Access revoked');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"单点登录与组织访问\">单点登录与组织访问</h2><p><strong>企业场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持 SAML / OIDC 协议。</li>\n<li>根据用户组自动分配角色。</li>\n<li>集中化管理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常用工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Auth0、Clerk、WorkOS。</li>\n<li>自建后端。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"公开文档\">公开文档</h2><p><strong>公开可读</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可被搜索引擎索引。</li>\n<li>匿名访问。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>体验设计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>显示&quot;公开&quot;标识。</li>\n<li>设为公开前需确认。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>审计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>记录公开链接的分享行为。</li>\n<li>支持撤销。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"权限继承\">权限继承</h2><p><strong>文件夹/工作区级别</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文档继承所属文件夹的权限。</li>\n<li>也可单独覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常见模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工作区成员默认为编辑者。</li>\n<li>文档所有者可进一步限制权限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"liveblocks-权限方案\">Liveblocks 权限方案</h2><p><strong>托管模式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { authorize } from &#39;@liveblocks/node&#39;;&#10;&#10;app.post(&#39;/api/liveblocks-auth&#39;, async (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const userId = await getUser(req);&#10;  const role = await getRole(userId, req.body.room);&#10;&#10;  const response = await authorize({&#10;    room: req.body.room,&#10;    userId,&#10;    userInfo: { name, color },&#10;    permissions: role === &#39;editor&#39; ? [&#39;room:write&#39;] : [&#39;room:read&#39;],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  res.send(response);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { authorize } from '@liveblocks/node';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.post('/api/liveblocks-auth', async (req, res) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const userId = await getUser(req);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const role = await getRole(userId, req.body.room);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const response = await authorize({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    room: req.body.room,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    userId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    userInfo: { name, color },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    permissions: role === 'editor' ? ['room:write'] : ['room:read'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  res.send(response);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务端签发令牌——客户端使用令牌连接</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权限相关接口\">权限相关接口</h2><p><strong>服务端接口设计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>POST /docs/:id/share（邀请成员）</li>\n<li>DELETE /docs/:id/members/:userId（移除成员）</li>\n<li>PATCH /docs/:id/members/:userId（变更角色）</li>\n<li>PATCH /docs/:id（修改可见性/链接分享设置）</li>\n<li>GET /docs/:id/audit（审计日志）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 仅在客户端检查权限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可通过开发者工具绕过。</li>\n<li>必须在服务端强制校验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 不记录审计日志</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>出问题时无法追溯。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 角色过多</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户容易混淆。</li>\n<li>建议不超过 4-5 个角色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 撤销权限后不立即断开连接</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>被移除的用户仍能看到实时更新。</li>\n<li>应立即强制断开连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 默认公开</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存在隐私泄露风险。</li>\n<li>应默认私有。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 不向用户展示其当前角色</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户会困惑&quot;为什么我不能编辑？&quot;</li>\n<li>应显示&quot;仅查看&quot;指示器。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 以服务端校验为主</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>永远不信任客户端。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 客户端做界面提示</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对查看者禁用编辑功能。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 使用标准角色层级</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有者、编辑者、评论者、查看者。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 同时支持邮件邀请和链接分享</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两者都是常见的分享方式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 对关键操作记录审计日志</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分享、角色变更、删除等操作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 权限变更实时生效</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>撤销权限时立即断开连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"liveblocks-与自建方案对比\">Liveblocks 与自建方案对比</h2><p><strong>Liveblocks</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内置权限系统。</li>\n<li>配置简单。</li>\n<li>自定义空间有限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自建方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全可控。</li>\n<li>实现复杂度更高。</li>\n<li>适合有特殊需求的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>协作应用的访问控制核心是角色体系——所有者、编辑者、评论者、查看者，配合邮件邀请、链接分享和组织级范围三种分享方式。服务端对每次变更操作进行权威校验，客户端则做界面层提示（不展示用户无权操作的功能）。分享弹窗遵循行业标准模式（Google Docs / Notion）——成员列表配角色选择器、邮箱添加、链接分享开关配角色选择。邮件邀请流程为输入邮箱和角色 → 服务端发送邮件 → 收件人点击登录并接受，待处理的邀请可取消。链接分享通过令牌实现，可轮换令牌来撤销，可通过邮箱白名单或组织范围加以限制。组织内部默认给予查看或评论权限，外部用户需显式邀请且权限更严格。基于 CRDT 操作的权限控制通过中间件在应用操作前检查，操作级粒度对原始 CRDT 较难实现但对结构化操作（评论与正文分离）较容易。只读模式设置编辑器为不可编辑且不发布感知状态。仅评论模式允许阅读和添加评论但不能编辑正文。审计日志记录用户、文档、操作类型和时间戳，仅管理员或所有者可在&quot;活动记录&quot;标签页查看。实时权限变更时服务端关闭 WebSocket 连接，客户端收到断开通知并显示&quot;访问已撤销&quot;。企业场景使用 SAML/OIDC 单点登录并根据用户组自动分配角色。公开文档可被搜索引擎索引，需确认才能设为公开，并记录审计。权限可从文件夹或工作区继承，也可单独覆盖。Liveblocks 提供内置权限令牌签发机制，自建方案则更灵活。应避免的反模式包括：仅客户端检查（可绕过）、不记录审计日志（无法追溯）、角色过多（用户混淆）、撤销后不立即断开（残留访问）、默认公开（隐私泄露）、不展示当前角色（用户困惑）。实战建议：服务端校验为主、客户端做界面提示、使用标准角色层级、同时支持邮件和链接分享、对关键操作记录审计、权限变更实时生效。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"权限与角色","id":"权限与角色"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"角色层级","id":"角色层级"},{"level":2,"text":"权限检查","id":"权限检查"},{"level":2,"text":"分享体验","id":"分享体验"},{"level":2,"text":"邮件邀请","id":"邮件邀请"},{"level":2,"text":"链接分享","id":"链接分享"},{"level":2,"text":"组织级范围","id":"组织级范围"},{"level":2,"text":"基于 CRDT 操作的权限控制","id":"基于-crdt-操作的权限控制"},{"level":2,"text":"只读模式","id":"只读模式"},{"level":2,"text":"仅评论模式","id":"仅评论模式"},{"level":2,"text":"审计日志","id":"审计日志"},{"level":2,"text":"实时权限变更","id":"实时权限变更"},{"level":2,"text":"单点登录与组织访问","id":"单点登录与组织访问"},{"level":2,"text":"公开文档","id":"公开文档"},{"level":2,"text":"权限继承","id":"权限继承"},{"level":2,"text":"Liveblocks 权限方案","id":"liveblocks-权限方案"},{"level":2,"text":"权限相关接口","id":"权限相关接口"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"Liveblocks 与自建方案对比","id":"liveblocks-与自建方案对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"冲突反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/conflict-feedback"},"next":{"title":"服务器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/server-architecture"}}